</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">How long does it take to scale AEO across a full product portfolio?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">Most organizations complete full portfolio integration within 6 months, following a phased approach that starts with core products and expands systematically to adjacent segments.</p>
</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">How do you maintain brand consistency when scaling AEO across different market segments?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">Maintain brand consistency by establishing core messaging guidelines that specify which elements must remain constant across all segments while identifying areas where customization is appropriate. Create modular content templates that preserve brand voice while allowing segment-specific pain points and vocabulary to be addressed.</p>
</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">What automation tools are essential for scaling AEO across multiple product lines?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">Essential automation tools include content auditing systems that check schema markup and content freshness, performance monitoring that tracks AEO metrics across all segments, and content update workflows that ensure consistency across product lines. The six-engine analysis framework provides automated optimization across multiple AI platforms.</p>
</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">How should teams be structured when implementing AEO across different product lines?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">Implement a center of excellence model with centralized AEO expertise supporting dedicated resources for each product line. Create cross-functional teams including product marketing, content creation, and technical specialists while establishing clear performance accountability for each segment.</p>
</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">What metrics should be tracked when scaling AEO across multiple segments?</h3>
