</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">How do you prioritize AEO efforts when resources are limited across multiple product lines?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">Prioritize based on market opportunity size, competitive pressure intensity, and existing performance gaps. Focus initial efforts on segments with the highest potential ROI while building scalable processes that can be replicated across other product lines as resources become available.</p>
</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">What are the biggest challenges when scaling AEO across different market segments?</h3>
